                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_08": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Pieces from our collection take 7 to 14 business days to process, plus delivery time. As soon as your order is on its way, we’ll send you a shipping confirmation email with your tracking number. The tracking link can take up to 24 hours to show updates, so hang tight if it looks quiet at first.</p>",
