                    "heading": "Can I cancel or update my order?",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_11": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Once an order is placed, we’re not able to cancel or make changes to it. We know that can be frustrating, and we’re sorry for any inconvenience. If you have any questions, email us at <a href=\"mailto:helloauracapital@gmail.com\">helloauracapital@gmail.com</a> and we’ll do everything we can to help.</p>",
