                  "blocks": {
                    "text_12": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We’re sorry, and we’re here to fix it. Email us at <a href=\"mailto:helloauracapital@gmail.com\">helloauracapital@gmail.com</a> with your order number and a quick rundown of what happened, and we’ll take it from there.</p>",
