                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Aura Capital does not cover any duties, taxes or associated handling fees which may be applied to your order by your local government. You will be responsible for these costs upon delivery. Please contact your local customs office for more information. We are not responsible for replacing or refunding any orders that are stuck in customs clearance.</p>",
